        acb_2 1e-3;     Z-Covariance of initial accelerometer bias [m^2/s^4]
        gyb_0 5e-5;     X-Covariance of initial gyroscope bias [rad^2/s^2]
        gyb_1 5e-5;     Y-Covariance of initial gyroscope bias [rad^2/s^2]
        gyb_2 5e-5;     Z-Covariance of initial gyroscope bias [rad^2/s^2]
